      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Opens a bilingual Weekly Epidemiological Record statement on meningococcal polysaccharide vaccines newly licensed in the United States against serogroups A and C. It reviews the history of meningococcal epidemics, the decline of serogroup C disease in military recruits after routine vaccination, and the current serogroup and age distribution of cases. The page ends with the issue's table of contents.",
